  (text "LCD: Sharp LS027B7DH01, 2.7 in, 400 x 240, reflective, -20 to +70 C. SPI write-only, LSB first, SCS active high, up to 1-2 MHz (LD-28305A table 6-3-1)."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "7867baa2-55ad-c7c9-9bbe-5a004e9e140f"))
  (text "LCD VCOM: EXTMODE high, TIM15_CH1 toggles EXTCOMIN at 1-20 Hz, below the frame rate (remark 6-3). Logic from 3.3 V (VIH min 2.7 V)."
    (at 20 262 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "85860cbb-151e-3515-c5dd-21f1c5157973"))
  (text "LCD 5 V from a TPS61222 boost (4.82-5.13 V); the panel draws 50-350 uW. EN low would still leave 3.3 V on VOUT (body diode), so EN stays high."
    (at 20 267 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1d04da9e-346e-0e57-1a96-3c0c5dd07efa"))
  (text "LCD FPC: 9.5 mm wide, about 12.9 mm long, centred on the panel; it folds 180 deg under the glass (never toward the front polariser) into J61."
    (at 20 272 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1d36699e-4853-2a97-d637-31c74cd16555"))
  (text "Keys: three Kailh Choc V1 tactile switches (3 mm travel, 1.5 mm to actuation, 50 gf) with printed caps, in SMD hotswap sockets on the back; the case front is the switch plate (13.8 mm square cut-outs). UP / DOWN use the MCU's internal pull-ups; debounce in firmware."
    (at 20 277 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "c6c22852-1b74-1276-952b-a724c36cdc39"))
  (text "OK doubles as the power key (latch on the power sheet). While logging, any key is a marker; the external marker on J62 stays."
    (at 20 282 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "124811d8-df06-dcd4-e895-b063a918c520"))
  (text "Marker input: 1k series, 10k pull-up, 100 nF (1 ms) against cable noise; EXTI15 on PA15, timestamped from TIM2."
    (at 20 287 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "45a643e7-b599-f2c4-e8c7-88bea21553dd"))
  (text "Expansion 3V3 goes through a 100 mA PTC so a shorted cable cannot pull down the logger."
    (at 20 292 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "9be87c57-eab5-9ca7-68bd-4fe2625c6bb7")))
